# Agent harness — local, per-machine, never committed.
# settings.local.json accumulates per-machine tool permissions: absolute home
# paths, other projects' file layouts, and which third-party services this
# machine talks to. None of it is a secret, none of it belongs in a public repo.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktree.md
.claude/.worktree-setup.lock/
.claude/launch.json
.mcp.json

